---One entry in a memory's history, recording a single change and who made it.
---
---Every change to a memory adds one version. Only redaction can change a version after that. Versions belong to the memory store and stay after the memory is deleted. Each version is retained for at least the version retention period after it was written, unless the store itself is deleted.
---
---Retrieving a redacted version succeeds, with `content`, `path`, `content_size_bytes`, and `content_sha256` set to `null`. Check `redacted_at` to find out whether a version was redacted.
---
---See the [memory guide](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/managed-agents/memory#audit-memory-changes) to learn more about memory versions.
---@class anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsMemoryVersion
---@field type string
---@field id string Unique identifier for this version (a `memver_...` value).
---@field memory_store_id string ID of the memory store this version belongs to (a `memstore_...` value).
---@field memory_id string The ID of the memory that this version belongs to (`mem_...`). The ID stays valid after the memory is deleted. Pass it as `memory_id` to [List Memory Versions](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/beta/memory_stores/memory_versions/list) to get the memory's retained versions, including its `deleted` version while the lineage is retained.
---@field path? string|distilled.Null The memory's path at the time of this write. `null` if and only if `redacted_at` is set.
---@field operation anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsMemoryVersionOperation The kind of mutation this version records: `created`, `modified`, or `deleted`.
---@field content? string|distilled.Null The memory's UTF-8 text content as of this version. `null` when `view=basic`, when `operation` is `deleted`, or when `redacted_at` is set.
---@field content_size_bytes? number|distilled.Null Size of `content` in bytes as of this version. `null` when `redacted_at` is set or `operation` is `deleted`. Populated regardless of `view` otherwise.
---@field content_sha256? string|distilled.Null Lowercase hex SHA-256 digest of `content` as of this version (64 characters). `null` when `redacted_at` is set or `operation` is `deleted`. Populated regardless of `view` otherwise.
---@field created_by? anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsActor Who made this change to the memory, or `null` if the author wasn't recorded. Redacting the version doesn't change this field. A `session_actor` here is an agent that wrote through the store's mounted filesystem at `/mnt/memory/`. The version doesn't record the API key that created that session. So the author in `created_by` is who made the change, not who is ultimately responsible for it. You can [retrieve the session](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/beta/sessions/retrieve) to learn more about where the change came from.
---@field created_at string When this version was written, in RFC 3339 format.
---@field redacted_at? string|distilled.Null When the version was redacted, in RFC 3339, or `null` if it hasn't been. When set, `content`, `path`, `content_size_bytes`, and `content_sha256` are `null`. See the [memory guide](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/managed-agents/memory#redact-a-version) to learn more about redaction.
---@field redacted_by? anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsActor Who redacted this version, or `null` if it has not been redacted. In practice always an `api_actor`, `user_actor`, or `service_account_actor` (agents do not have a redact capability).

---The kind of change that a memory version records.
---
---Every change to a memory adds one version. If you update a memory and nothing changes, the memory doesn't get a new version.
---@alias anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsMemoryVersionOperation "created"|"modified"|"deleted"

---Whether a `memory` or `memory_version` in the response includes its `content`. Defaults to `full` on retrieve operations and to `basic` on list, create, and update operations.
---
---With `full`, list operations return at most 20 items per page.
---@alias anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsMemoryView "basic"|"full"

