---@class anthropic.beta_memory_stores.ListMemoriesRequest
---@field memory_store_id string The ID of the memory store to list memories from (`memstore_...`).
---@field path_prefix? string Return only memories whose path starts with this prefix, such as `/notes/`. This value appears in request URLs. Do not include secrets or personally identifiable information. Omit it to list the whole store. The prefix must end with `/` and matches whole segments, so `/notes/` matches `/notes/todo.md` but not `/notes-archive/todo.md`.
---@field depth? number How far below `path_prefix` to list. Defaults to `0`, which lists every memory below the prefix. Pass `1` to list only the direct children. Deeper memories are then grouped into `memory_prefix` items.
---@field limit? number The maximum number of items to return per page, from 1 to 100. Defaults to 20. With `view=full`, a page holds at most 20 items. `memory` and `memory_prefix` items both count toward the limit.
---@field page? string The `next_page` value from a previous response, to get the next page. Omit it to get the first page.
---@field view? anthropic.beta_memory_stores.BetaManagedAgentsMemoryView|string Whether each memory in the response includes `content`. Defaults to `basic`, which sets it to `null`. With `full`, a page holds at most 20 items.
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
---@field anthropicBeta? anthropic.beta_memory_stores.ListMemoriesRequestAnthropicBetaList This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `agent-memory-2026-07-22` or `managed-agents-2026-04-01` in this header.
