---This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `agent-memory-2026-07-22` or `managed-agents-2026-04-01` in this header.
---@alias anthropic.beta_memory_stores.ListMemoriesRequestAnthropicBetaList anthropic.beta_memory_stores.AnthropicBeta[]

